  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added Multi-targeting support for netstandard2.0 and net10.0.\n\t\t\t- Introduced high-performance, AOT-safe XML parser for .NET 10 (replacing XmlSerializer).\n\t\t\t- Improved Field.WriteValue with automatic numeric type conversion support.\n\t\t\t- Optimized SignalEngine integration with message-grouped channel processing.\n\t\t\t- Added IsAotCompatible flag for modern .NET environments.",
